        "答案 $\\frac{3\\sqrt{\\pi}/4}{8\\sqrt{2}}=\\frac{3\\sqrt{\\pi}}{32\\sqrt{2}}\\approx 0.1175$。"
      ],
      "answer": "$\\frac{3\\sqrt{\\pi}}{32\\sqrt{2}}$",
      "claim": "INT(x^4*e^(-2x^2), 0, inf) == 3*sqrt(pi)/(32*sqrt(2))"
